---
const photo = 'https://kimi-web-img.kimi.ai/img/content.elmueble.com/cf797b64f4ec8e4a306e1b70f57ceefd5b443fdf.jpg';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ca">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="description" content="Serveis de neteja pensats per cuidar casa teva amb atenció i respecte." />
  <title>El Setè Cel · Cura de la llar</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/sticky-header.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="El Setè Cel, inici">el setè <strong>cel</strong></a>
    <nav aria-label="Navegació principal"><a href="/" target="_top">Inici</a><a href="/serveis/" target="_top">Serveis</a><a href="/sobre-nosaltres/" target="_top">Sobre nosaltres</a><a href="/#cta" target="_top">Contacte</a></nav>
    <a class="header-link" href="#contacte">Parlem de casa teva <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </header>
  <main id="inici">
    <section class="hero section-wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero-image" style={`background-image:url('${photo}')`}>
        <div class="hero-card"><span class="eyebrow gold">Benvinguda a casa</span><h1 id="hero-title">Una casa cuidada.<br />Temps per viure-la.</h1><p>Ens ocupem de la neteja perquè puguis gaudir dels petits moments que fan que casa teva sigui casa teva.</p><a class="button" href="#contacte">Parlem-ne <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        <span class="hero-side" aria-hidden="true">El Setè Cel · Cura de la llar</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-foot"><p>Una atenció propera per als espais que importen.</p><a href="#manera">La nostra manera de fer <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
    </section>
    <section class="intro section-wrap" id="manera"><div><span class="eyebrow">La nostra manera de fer</span><h2>La tranquil·litat comença pels petits detalls.</h2></div><div class="intro-copy"><p>Cada casa té el seu ritme. Per això comencem escoltant què necessites i quins espais vols cuidar.</p><p>Amb atenció, respecte i una manera de treballar clara, t’ajudem a trobar una solució que encaixi amb el teu dia a dia.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contacte">Explica’ns què necessites <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
    <section class="services section-wrap" id="serveis"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Els nostres serveis</span><h2>Una cura per a cada moment.</h2></div><p>Des del manteniment habitual fins a una neteja més profunda, trobem la manera de cuidar casa teva.</p></div><div class="service-grid"><article><div class="service-image service-one" role="img" aria-label="Interior acollidor d’una llar"></div><div class="service-body"><span class="service-number">01 / Cura habitual</span><h3>Neteja estàndard</h3><p>Una posada a punt dels espais que fas servir cada dia, al ritme que necessitis.</p><a href="#contacte">Parlem d’aquest servei <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article><article><div class="service-image service-two" role="img" aria-label="Cuina lluminosa"></div><div class="service-body"><span class="service-number">02 / Més a fons</span><h3>Neteja a fons</h3><p>Per dedicar més temps als espais i racons que necessiten una atenció especial.</p><a href="#contacte">Parlem d’aquest servei <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article><article><div class="service-image service-three" role="img" aria-label="Habitació preparada per a una nova etapa"></div><div class="service-body"><span class="service-number">03 / Una nova etapa</span><h3>Entrega de claus</h3><p>Una neteja per preparar l’habitatge abans d’una mudança o d’entregar les claus.</p><a href="#contacte">Parlem d’aquest servei <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article></div></section>
    <section class="choice section-wrap"><div class="choice-inner"><div class="choice-intro"><span class="eyebrow">A la teva mida</span><h2>Tu ens expliques què necessites. Nosaltres t’ajudem a triar.</h2><p>Una neteja completa o temps per a algunes zones: comencem per allò que és important per a tu.</p></div><div class="choice-options"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>Preu tancat</h3><p>Acordem els espais i el preu abans de començar. Una opció per a una neteja completa.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>Per hores</h3><p>Tries el temps i ens indiques quines zones vols prioritzar, com la cuina o el bany.</p></div></article></div></div></section>
    <section class="contact section-wrap" id="contacte"><div><span class="eyebrow">Comencem?</span><h2>Parlem de casa teva.</h2><p>Explica’ns què necessites i t’ajudarem a trobar la millor manera de començar.</p><a class="button light-button" href="mailto:hola@example.com">Escriu-nos <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="contact-note">Cada llar és diferent.<br />Ens agradarà conèixer la teva.</p></section>
  </main>
  <footer class="footer section-wrap"><a class="wordmark" href="#inici">el setè <strong>cel</strong></a><p>Una manera més agradable de ser a casa.</p><a href="#inici">Torna a dalt ↑</a></footer>
  <style>
    :root{font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;color:#23201b;background:#fbfaf6;font-synthesis:none;scroll-behavior:smooth}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}a{color:inherit}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #b08d57;outline-offset:5px}h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}h1,h2,h3{font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.025em}.section-wrap{padding-left:clamp(1.4rem,4vw,4rem);padding-right:clamp(1.4rem,4vw,4rem)}.site-header{min-height:88px;padding:1.3rem clamp(1.4rem,4vw,4rem);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:2rem}.wordmark{font-size:1.3rem;letter-spacing:-.06em;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}.wordmark strong{font-weight:700}.site-header nav{display:flex;gap:2rem}.site-header nav a,.header-link{font-size:.75rem;text-decoration:none}.header-link{border-bottom:1px solid #b08d57;padding-bottom:.45rem}.hero{padding-top:2rem}.hero-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem}.hero-top>a,.hero-foot a{font-size:.72rem;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #b08d57;padding-bottom:.35rem}.eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;color:#2e4638;font-size:.67rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase}.eyebrow:before{content:'';width:26px;height:1px;background:currentColor}.gold{color:#76592e}.hero-image{height:min(76vh,700px);min-height:500px;background-position:center;background-size:cover;position:relative;border-radius:4px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:clamp(1.2rem,3.5vw,3rem)}.hero-card{width:min(100%,470px);padding:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.6rem);background:rgba(247,244,238,.96);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.6);border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 30px 70px -30px rgba(20,32,26,.5)}.hero-card h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,3vw,3rem);line-height:1.16;margin:1.2rem 0}.hero-card p,.intro-copy p,.section-heading p,.choice-intro p,.contact p{font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.8;color:#4a453c}.button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:1.5rem;background:#2e4638;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px;padding:1rem 1.4rem;font-size:.73rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;margin-top:1.5rem}.button:hover{background:#1e332a}.hero-side{position:absolute;right:2rem;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);writing-mode:vertical-rl;color:white;text-shadow:0 1px 8px #000;font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase}.hero-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;padding:1.5rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dedbd3}.hero-foot p{font-size:.8rem;color:#4a453c}.intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(3rem,10vw,10rem);padding-top:clamp(6rem,11vw,11rem);padding-bottom:clamp(6rem,11vw,11rem)}.intro h2,.section-heading h2,.choice h2,.contact h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,3.6vw,3.4rem);line-height:1.2;margin-top:1.4rem;max-width:19ch}.intro-copy{max-width:34rem;padding-top:2.5rem}.intro-copy p+p{margin-top:1.1rem}.text-link,.service-body a{display:inline-block;margin-top:1.7rem;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #b08d57;padding-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600}.services{padding-top:clamp(4rem,8vw,7rem);padding-bottom:clamp(5rem,9vw,9rem);background:#f1eee7}.section-heading{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:2rem;margin-bottom:3rem}.section-heading p{max-width:35ch}.service-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.2rem}.service-grid article{background:#fbfaf6}.service-image{height:clamp(220px,25vw,360px);background-size:cover;background-position:center}.service-one{background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492486-724fe5c67fb0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80')}.service-two{background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687939-ce8a6c25118c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80')}.service-three{background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600566753086-00f18fb6b3ea?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80')}.service-body{padding:1.8rem}.service-number{font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#76592e}.service-body h3{font-size:1.5rem;margin:1rem 0}.service-body p{font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.75;color:#4a453c}.choice{padding-top:clamp(5rem,9vw,9rem);padding-bottom:clamp(5rem,9vw,9rem)}.choice-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(3rem,10vw,10rem);background:#e7e9e1;padding:clamp(2rem,5vw,5rem)}.choice-intro p{margin-top:1.4rem;max-width:36ch}.choice-options article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr;gap:1rem;padding:1.7rem 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(35,32,27,.2)}.choice-options article>span{font-size:.7rem;color:#76592e}.choice-options h3{font-size:1.45rem;margin-bottom:.7rem}.choice-options p{font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#4a453c;max-width:36ch}.contact{background:#2e4638;color:#f7f4ee;padding-top:clamp(5rem,9vw,9rem);padding-bottom:clamp(5rem,9vw,9rem);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:3rem}.contact .eyebrow{color:#e8d3a8}.contact p{color:#e0e5dc;margin-top:1.3rem;max-width:38ch}.light-button{background:#f7f4ee;color:#263c30}.light-button:hover{background:#e2d9c6}.contact .contact-note{font-size:.8rem}.footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:2rem;padding-top:2.5rem;padding-bottom:2.5rem}.footer p,.footer>a:last-child{font-size:.75rem;color:#4a453c}.footer>a:last-child{text-decoration:none}@media(max-width:760px){.site-header nav{display:none}.header-link{font-size:.7rem}.hero{padding-top:1rem}.hero-image{height:auto;min-height:580px;padding-top:15rem}.hero-side{display:none}.hero-foot{align-items:flex-start}.intro,.choice-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}.intro-copy{padding-top:0}.section-heading{display:block}.section-heading p{margin-top:1.2rem}.service-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.service-image{height:260px}.contact{display:block}.contact .contact-note{margin-top:3rem}.footer{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){:root{scroll-behavior:auto}}
    /* El lenguaje de la hero se repite en la página: fotografía enmarcada,
       paneles claros superpuestos y líneas finas de separación. */
    .intro{gap:0;align-items:stretch}
    .intro>div,.intro-copy{padding:clamp(2rem,4vw,4rem);border:1px solid rgba(35,32,27,.14);background:#fbfaf6}
    .intro>div+div{border-left:0}
    .intro h2,.section-heading h2,.choice h2,.contact h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3.6vw,3rem);line-height:1.16}
    .services{background:#fbfaf6}
    .service-grid{gap:1rem}
    .service-grid article{position:relative;min-height:540px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:4px;background:#dedbd3;box-shadow:0 40px 90px -40px rgba(35,32,27,.3);display:flex;align-items:end;padding:1.2rem}
    .service-image{position:absolute;inset:0;height:auto}
    .service-body{position:relative;width:100%;padding:clamp(1.4rem,2.2vw,2rem);background:rgba(247,244,238,.96);border:1px solid rgba(247,244,238,.6);border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 30px 70px -30px rgba(20,32,26,.45)}
    .service-body h3{font-size:clamp(1.35rem,1.7vw,1.75rem)}
    .choice{padding-top:clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem)}
    .choice-inner{position:relative;min-height:570px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:clamp(1.2rem,3.5vw,3rem);border-radius:4px;background:#8c8676 url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687939-ce8a6c25118c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;box-shadow:0 40px 90px -40px rgba(35,32,27,.35)}
    .choice-intro,.choice-options{background:rgba(247,244,238,.97)}
    .choice-intro{width:min(100%,450px);padding:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.6rem);border:1px solid rgba(247,244,238,.6);border-radius:6px 0 0 6px}
    .choice-intro h2{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,2.6vw,2.1rem)}
    .choice-options{width:min(100%,380px);padding:1.3rem clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.5rem);border:1px solid rgba(247,244,238,.6);border-left:1px solid rgba(35,32,27,.14);border-radius:0 6px 6px 0;align-self:end}
    .choice-options article:first-child{border-top:0}
    .contact{background:#f7f4ee;color:#23201b;align-items:stretch;padding-top:clamp(4rem,8vw,7rem);padding-bottom:clamp(4rem,8vw,7rem)}
    .contact>div,.contact .contact-note{border:1px solid rgba(35,32,27,.14);padding:clamp(2rem,4vw,4rem);margin:0}
    .contact>div{flex:1}.contact .eyebrow{color:#2e4638}.contact p{color:#4a453c}.contact .contact-note{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;max-width:none;width:30%;border-left:0}
    .contact .light-button{background:#2e4638;color:#f7f4ee}.contact .light-button:hover{background:#1e332a}
    .footer{border-top:1px solid rgba(35,32,27,.14)}
    @media(max-width:760px){.intro>div+div{border-left:1px solid rgba(35,32,27,.14);border-top:0}.service-grid article{min-height:460px}.choice-inner{display:block;padding-top:14rem;min-height:0}.choice-intro,.choice-options{width:100%;border-radius:6px}.choice-options{border-left:1px solid rgba(247,244,238,.6);border-top:1px solid rgba(35,32,27,.14);border-radius:0 0 6px 6px}.choice-intro{border-radius:6px 6px 0 0}.contact .contact-note{width:100%;border-left:1px solid rgba(35,32,27,.14);border-top:0;margin:0}}
  </style>
<script is:inline src="/sticky-header.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
